<title>SOUTH AFRICA: LA STORES IN TALKS, CAUTIONS SHAREHOLDERS.</title>
<headline>LA STORES IN TALKS, CAUTIONS SHAREHOLDERS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>L.A. Retail Stores Ltd said on Monday it was in talks which, if successfully concluded, could have an affect on its share price on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their share dealings until further notice.</p>
<p>The firm gave no further details in a brief announcement.</p>
